"795","Pascal METENIER","Pascal","METENIER","INNOVATIVE 💡 and COMMITTED 🌎 plastics entrepreneur","https://linkedin.com/in/pascalmetenier","La Planche, Pays de la Loire, France","France","La Planche, Pays de la Loire","3588","2987","Welcome to my LinkedIn profile. Graduated from my engineering school in 1987, I wanted to extend my learning through greater international openness. The year spent in California at the prestigious Stanford University thus constituted a major turning point in my perception of the world. Incredible discovery of an educational system based on the ""customer / supplier"" relationship between the teacher and his students, extreme geographical diversity of the students. It was there that I became aware of being a “citizen of the world”.

