"1319","Herwig Juster","Herwig","Juster","ISO/IEC 17024 Certified Plastics Expert Witness I Material Selection & Failure Analysis I KAM @ Syensqo I Blogger @ FindOutAboutPlastics.com I Author of “Polymer Material Selection - A Practical Guide”","https://linkedin.com/in/herwigjuster","Landsberg, Bavaria, Germany","Germany","Landsberg, Bavaria","5224","4004","As a passionate polymer engineer and plastics industry expert, I help innovators, engineers, and purchasing professionals unlock the full potential of advanced polymer solutions. With over a decade of hands-on experience—currently as Key Account Manager at Syensqo (formerly Solvay Specialty Polymers)—I bridge the gap between technical requirements and real-world applications for high-performance plastics.

